insufficient to certify that result.\n\n3. Required combined-check qualification,17.5–17.7. The current design skips export cases when the route is absent, while17.6 calls every zero exit a passed required check. An integration tree that removes/omits exportProject can therefore exit0 with the required export cases skipped. Make the actual required combined command/configuration demand the feature's complete outcome evidence and refuse to pass when the route or required cases are absent. Concern/baseline checks may explicitly report partial applicability; that evidence is never the required feature result. Include the minimal missing-route control alongside the wrong-parameter failure and repaired success. Distinguish install/runner/infrastructure error from an assertion failure in the job result, consistent with R2's declared check states. No numerical test quota or whole-platform sweep.\n\n4. Repeatable complete acceptance,17.10 T7/T8. Real agents may repair the provisional type parameter before the first manifest; that honest success does not prove the failed-combined-check/steering/review path. Specify an owned controlled actual-commit failure variant or another explicit reproducible method, labelled as such, with the complete user/agent/browser path retained. A fake phone document is a bounded unit witness only; real-device defect/refusal and downloaded-file outcomes remain separately demonstrated. Keep unknown provider effects and all fifteen steps intact; do not claim a scripted actor or mock is the hosted acceptance.\n\nBefore the baseline source request, pin a supported exact Node version and validate its actual test-discovery command/local-listen capability at the commissioned hosted/checker boundary; no version compatibility or measured seconds is proved by this note. Final repository/account/licence/publication choices remain named, and source/repository publication is not commissioned by this correction.\n\nRetain the complete R2 scope, current G19/R1/R